&lt;li&gt;Reputation for consistently delivering results and setting the example for work ethic, initiative, enthusiasm, and commitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to develop rapport with new people, and to maintain relationships, combined with a positive, outgoing personality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding oral, written and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to distill and explain complex issues in simple terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert communicator with the ability to comfortably communicate across all levels of an organization&lt;/li&gt;
